  "properties": {
    "title": "Confessions of a Natural Intelligence Vibe Coder?",
    "description": "\u201cVibe coding emphasizes creative flow: the human developer accepts AI-suggestions liberally and focuses on iterative experimentation rather than code correctness\u201d (Wikipedia). I am an Academic working with FOSS4G for 20+ years. Am I a Natural Intelligence vibe coder? This is that story.\n\nAn examination of FOSS4G in academica from a personal perspective. Vibe coding ain't new.",
